{
  "id": "E281",
  "title": "Losing Weight with Fruit",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-12-09",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang is preparing for a wedding party by eating fruit. Why is she doing this?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/919/98ea6691e013fbe5f0aa6f88a4d106f4f3ca0b86.mp3?1543807886",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你怎么不吃饭\n\n小何：已经十二点了，我们去吃饭吧。小张，你要一起去吗？\n小张：我就不去了，我今天带午饭了。\n小何：是吗？你带了什么？\n小张：我带了苹果、芒果、牛油果，还有奇异果。\n小何：都是水果，你怎么不吃饭？\n小张：下个月我要去我朋友的婚礼，现在得减肥。\n小何：可是，水果里有很多糖。你确定这么吃真的能减肥吗？",
    "traditional": "你怎麼不吃飯\n\n小何：已經十二點了，我們去吃飯吧。小張，你要一起去嗎？\n小張：我就不去了，我今天帶午飯了。\n小何：是嗎？你帶了什麼？\n小張：我帶了蘋果、芒果、牛油果，還有奇異果。\n小何：都是水果，你怎麼不吃飯？\n小張：下個月我要去我朋友的婚禮，現在得減肥。\n小何：可是，水果裡有很多糖。你確定這麼吃真的能減肥嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How come you’re not eating?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：已经十二点了，我们去吃饭吧。小张，你要一起去吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：已經十二點了，我們去吃飯吧。小張，你要一起去嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé yǐ jīng shí èr diǎn le wǒ men qù chī fàn ba xiǎo zhāng nǐ yào yì qǐ qù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: It’s already 12 o’clock. Let’s go for lunch! Little Zhang, do you want to come along?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：我就不去了，我今天带午饭了。",
      "traditional": "小張：我就不去了，我今天帶午飯了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ jiù bú qù le wǒ jīn tiān dài wǔ fàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I’m not going. I brought my own lunch today."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：是吗？你带了什么？",
      "traditional": "小何：是嗎？你帶了什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé shì ma nǐ dài le shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Really? What did you bring?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：我带了苹果、芒果、牛油果，还有奇异果。",
      "traditional": "小張：我帶了蘋果、芒果、牛油果，還有奇異果。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ dài le píng guǒ máng guǒ niú yóu guǒ hái yǒu qí yì guǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I brought an apple, a mango, an avocado, and a kiwi fruit."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小何：都是水果，你怎么不吃饭？",
      "traditional": "小何：都是水果，你怎麼不吃飯？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé dōu shì shuǐ guǒ nǐ zěn me bù chī fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: These are all fruits. How come you’re not having a meal?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小张：下个月我要去我朋友的婚礼，现在得减肥。",
      "traditional": "小張：下個月我要去我朋友的婚禮，現在得減肥。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xià ge yuè wǒ yào qù wǒ péng you de hūn lǐ xiàn zài děi jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Next month I’m going to my friend’s wedding, so now I need to lose weight."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小何：可是，水果里有很多糖。你确定这么吃真的能减肥吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：可是，水果裡有很多糖。你確定這麼吃真的能減肥嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé kě shì shuǐ guǒ lǐ yǒu hěn duō táng nǐ què dìng zhè me chī zhēn de néng jiǎn féi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: But fruit contains a lot of sugar. Are you sure you can lose weight eating this way?"
    }
  ],
